  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0165_6dd7cf96a41d.png\" style=\"width: 219px; height: 128px;\" /></p><p>Potential at origin&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math>, the potential due to two charges is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">4</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">d</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8722;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">d</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">6</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Potential at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;at a distance,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi></math>&nbsp;is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">4</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">d</mi></mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">+</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8722;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">d</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mfrac><mi>q</mi><mrow><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Change in potential energy due the charge motion of charge&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math>&nbsp;is given by</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8710;</mo><mi>U</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>V</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mi>q</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8722;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8658;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8710;</mo><mi>U</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mi>q</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8722;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>O</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>q</mi><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>q</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">0</mn></msub><mi>d</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
